# S14p in the world, host o (k2 without flag 505: the instance's story starts from that card, seed_story): hosts stag0101
# and stays near the entrance while g plays; g's 505 is the instance's (the host's) story: in o's engine at the same
# step (one stage group) and in o's online_story within ten seconds (story_saved).
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@60
explore mate00 yes until stage=stag0101,control
log o hosts
wander 460 170 15 until present=2,sealed>=300
log g joined
wander 460 170 15 until flag:505=1 or frames>=9000
log 505 in the field
wander 460 170 15 until present=1,frames>=60 or frames>=6000
idle until frames>=60
